    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.direction.wolf-nine.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.asset.sprite.wolf-nine",
        "actorId": "wolf-nine",
        "slot": "right",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "前夜祭を、九番の狼と回ることになった。誘われ方が、彼らしかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方、うちの郵便受けに挑戦状が八通。「夜店・全八種目。受けるか」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……受けます。受けますけど、八通は多い。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "一種目めは射的、二種目めは型抜き。三種目め、綿飴の早食いは、彼の圧勝だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "焼き餅屋のおばちゃんが囃す。「今夜は決闘かい!」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「祭りです!」どっちも、半分正解だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼は、勝負のたびに律儀に礼をする。去年まで、九戦目の結果は先に決められていた人だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「結果の分からない勝負は、ぜんぶ、ごちそうだ」だから今夜の八種目は、八皿の宴なのだった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "四つ勝って、四つ負けた。通算、四対四。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夜店の通りの端まで来て、私は気づいた。「九種目めは?」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "挑戦状は、八通しか来ていない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "狼は、耳の後ろを掻いた。強い人が、勝負以外で見せる仕草だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「九つ目は……挑戦状に、書けなかった」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "書けない種目が、あるんですか。「ある。勝ち負けが、無いやつだ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼は、まっすぐ立ち直して、言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミ。明日の柿落としが終わったら——次の祭りも、俺と回ってくれ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……九つ目は、挑戦ではなく、約束だった。初めて、名前で呼ばれた夜に。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "返事は、彼の流儀で返すことにした。人差し指を立てて、宣言する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「受けて立ちます。ただし、次の祭りの一種目めは、私が選びます」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "狼の尻尾が、正直に一回転した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道、彼は九通目の封筒をくれた。中身は、白紙だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「次の挑戦状は、二人で書く」……白紙の紙が、こんなに嬉しい夜も、ある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.eve.wolf-nine.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
